        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Korean Language Study Notes</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 12px;\n      background: #d9d9d5;\n      color: #171717;\n      font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Print\", \"Nanum Pen Script\",\n                   \"Malgun Gothic\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      width: 560px;\n      min-height: 790px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 12px 18px 13px 23px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,248,.90), rgba(255,255,245,.90)),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(\n          7deg,\n          rgba(90,80,50,.025) 0,\n          rgba(90,80,50,.025) 1px,\n          transparent 1px,\n          transparent 5px\n        );\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 9px rgba(0,0,0,.24);\n      transform-origin: top center;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 1.16;\n      letter-spacing: .25px;\n    }\n\n    .red { color: #8f2930; }\n    .black { color: #171717; }\n\n    .section {\n      position: relative;\n      margin-bottom: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .rule {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 128px 1fr;\n      align-items: start;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .rule-title {\n      margin-left: -17px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .rule-form {\n      font-size: 19px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .examples {\n      margin: 2px 0 0 45px;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n    }\n\n    .pronunciation {\n      margin-top: 22px;\n    }\n\n    .pronunciation-title {\n      margin-left: -17px;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n\n    .pron-row {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 27px 1fr 132px;\n      gap: 1px;\n      margin: 7px 0 12px 5px;\n      align-items: start;\n    }\n\n    .pron-num {\n      padding-top: 1px;\n    }\n\n    .pron-text {\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .pron-example {\n      padding-left: 13px;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 1.25;\n    }\n\n    .grammar-pair {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 135px 1fr;\n      align-items: start;\n      margin: 8px 0 0 -16px;\n      font-size: 19px;\n    }\n\n    .grammar-pair .formula {\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .small-note {\n      margin-left: 243px;\n      margin-top: -2px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .dialogue-zone {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 295px 1fr;\n      column-gap: 7px;\n      margin-top: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .dialogue {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 18px 1fr;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n    }\n\n    .brace {\n      font-family: Georgia, serif;\n      font-size: 94px;\n      line-height: .83;\n      transform: scaleX(.52);\n      transform-origin: left top;\n      margin-top: 0;\n    }\n\n    .dialogue-lines {\n      margin-left: -4px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .side-words {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      column-gap: 14px;\n      margin-top: 2px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.47;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .word-line {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 5px;\n    }\n\n    .vocabulary {\n      margin-top: 9px;\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-row {\n      display: grid;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      margin: 5px 0;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-row.top {\n      grid-template-columns: 41px 105px 145px 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-row.middle {\n      grid-template-columns: 41px 105px 147px 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-row.lower {\n      grid-template-columns: 41px 104px 146px 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-label {\n      color: #171717;\n      margin-left: -10px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .entry {\n      color: #8f2930;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .bottom-row {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 133px 197px 1fr;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      margin-top: 9px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 590px) {\n      body { padding: 0; }\n      .page {\n        width: 560px;\n        transform: scale(calc(100vw / 560));\n        margin-bottom: calc((100vw / 560 - 1) * 790px);\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"rule\">\n        <div class=\"rule-title red\">1. A不是B</div>\n        <div class=\"rule-form red\">A은/는&nbsp; B 이/가 아닙니다</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"examples black\">\n        <div>(저는)&nbsp; 학생이 아닙니다.</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-left:62px;\">我不是学生.</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:8px;\">이 사람은 가수가 아닙니다.</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-left:64px;\">这个人不是歌手.</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section pronunciation\">\n      <div class=\"pronunciation-title red\">2. “-의”的发音规则:</div>\n\n      <div class=\"pron-row\">\n        <div class=\"pron-num black\">①</div>\n        <div class=\"pron-text black\">当“-의”位于词首[illegible]时“의”音: <span class=\"red\">[의].</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pron-example red\">의사&nbsp; 의자</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pron-row\">\n        <div class=\"pron-num black\">②</div>\n        <div class=\"pron-text black\">当“-의”位于词中或词尾时发音为 <span class=\"red\">[이].</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pron-example red\">수의사，희망</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"pron-row\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n        <div class=\"pron-num black\">③</div>\n        <div class=\"pron-text black\">当“-의”作为“的”意思时，<span class=\"red\">[에]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pron-example red\">태양의 후예</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" style=\"margin-top:17px;\">\n      <div class=\"grammar-pair\">\n        <div class=\"black\">3. A是B的C</div>\n        <div class=\"formula black\">A은/는&nbsp; B 의&nbsp; C 입니다.</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-note black\">[예]</div>\n\n      <div class=\"grammar-pair\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n        <div class=\"black\">4. A不是B的C</div>\n        <div class=\"formula black\">A은/는&nbsp; B 의&nbsp; C 이/가 아닙니다.</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"dialogue-zone\">\n      <div class=\"dialogue\">\n        <div class=\"brace\">{</div>\n        <div class=\"dialogue-lines black\">\n          <div>이것은 무엇입니까?</div>\n          <div>이것은 가방입니다.</div>\n          <div>이것은 가방이 아닙니다.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"side-words black\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"word-line\"><span>그럼요</span><span>当然。</span></div>\n          <div class=\"word-line\"><span>당연히</span><span>当然?</span></div>\n          <div class=\"word-line\"><span>영어</span><span>英文</span></div>\n          <div class=\"word-line\"><span>모르겠습니다</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"word-line\"><span>친구</span><span>朋友</span></div>\n          <div class=\"word-line\"><span>우산</span><span>雨伞</span></div>\n          <div class=\"word-line\"><span>시계</span><span>表</span></div>\n          <div class=\"word-line\"><span>我不知道</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"vocabulary\">\n      <div class=\"vocab-row top\">\n        <div class=\"vocab-label\">生词:</div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">이것&nbsp; 这个</div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">무엇[뭐]&nbsp; 什么</div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">저-저의&nbsp; 我的</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vocab-row middle\">\n        <div></div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">가방&nbsp; 书包</div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">아니요&nbsp; 不是</div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">이/가 아닙니다&nbsp; 不是</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vocab-row lower\">\n        <div></div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">그래요&nbsp; 是吗</div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">그럼&nbsp; 那么</div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">한국어&nbsp; 韩语</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vocab-row lower\">\n        <div></div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">책&nbsp; 书</div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">알겠습니다</div>\n        <div class=\"entry\">我知道了（明白了）</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"bottom-row black\">\n      <div>그것&nbsp; 那个</div>\n      <div>저것&nbsp; 那个（距离很远）</div>\n      <div>핸드백&nbsp; 手提包&nbsp;&nbsp; 백팩&nbsp; 背包</div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
